1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,088
Big Mouth Baby
大嘴宝宝

2
00:00:08,211 --> 00:00:13,487
by Katie Clark
凯蒂·克拉克

3
00:00:15,811 --> 00:00:20,088
Max gets ready for his birthday party
Max为他的生日派对做准备

4
00:00:21,210 --> 00:00:24,888
He puts candles on his cake
他把蜡烛放在蛋糕上

5
00:00:26,010 --> 00:00:28,968
The baby grabs the candles
婴儿抓起蜡烛

6
00:00:30,971 --> 00:00:35,567
Max hangs Pin the Tail on the Donkey
麦克斯把尾巴钉在驴子身上

7
00:00:36,411 --> 00:00:39,688
The baby rips the tail
婴儿撕开尾巴

8
00:00:41,890 --> 00:00:45,927
Max blows up balloons
Max吹气球

9
00:00:47,011 --> 00:00:49,607
The baby pops the balloons
婴儿弹出气球

10
00:00:51,610 --> 00:00:58,527
Max says, "Stop!" The baby cries
麦克斯说，“住手！”婴儿哭了

11
00:01:00,451 --> 00:01:03,128
What a big mouth baby
真是个大嘴巴宝贝

12
00:01:05,730 --> 00:01:06,888
Party time!
派对时间！

13
00:01:08,370 --> 00:01:15,408
Max wishes for a horse when he blows out his candles
Max吹蜡烛的时候想要一匹马

14
00:01:16,450 --> 00:01:19,128
The baby smiles
宝宝笑了

15
00:01:20,771 --> 00:01:23,447
Max opens his presents
Max打开他的礼物

16
00:01:24,691 --> 00:01:27,328
The baby claps
婴儿拍手

17
00:01:28,811 --> 00:01:34,328
Max and his friends play party games
Max和他的朋友玩派对游戏

18
00:01:35,210 --> 00:01:37,287
The baby giggles
宝宝咯咯笑

19
00:01:39,531 --> 00:01:42,168
The guests go home
客人们都回家了

20
00:01:42,691 --> 00:01:44,768
Max smiles
Max笑了

21
00:01:45,210 --> 00:01:47,408
He hugs the baby
他拥抱着孩子

22
00:01:48,891 --> 00:01:54,808
The baby yells because he is happy
婴儿因为高兴而大叫

23
00:01:55,891 --> 00:01:58,567
The baby is so loud
宝宝声音好大

24
00:01:59,891 --> 00:02:03,888
Max covers his ears
Max捂住耳朵

25
00:02:04,771 --> 00:02:26,592
What a big mouth baby!
真是个大嘴巴宝贝！

